{"4440620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Archipelago Dreams", "steam_appid": 4440620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Archipelago Dreams is a dual top-down city builder and first person liminal experience. Freely select and place a variety of buildings and structures on prebuilt islands to make your own villages, cities or castle groups. Buildings can be easily rotated and placed on top of platforms that can also be placed by player. Place down docks to connect islands, build seaports, and spread out small villages on the ocean itself. Enter full immersion with First Person Mode and freely walk and jetpack around all of the islands. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4440620/extras/4b018d4b31368a463c05d892d9e98ef4.poster.avif?t=1784688994\" width=1080 height=606 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4440620/extras/4b018d4b31368a463c05d892d9e98ef4.webm?t=1784688994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4440620/extras/4b018d4b31368a463c05d892d9e98ef4.mp4?t=1784688994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter villages or castles, walk between buildings, hang out on rooftops, or find a place to relax and take beautiful screenshots. Free first person movement is available at all times at just the press of a button.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4440620/extras/6bdacf7a4604ee0b990e361ea93d401d.poster.avif?t=1784688994\" width=1080 height=606 ><so