paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4440620/extras/4b018d4b31368a463c05d892d9e98ef4.poster.avif?t=1784688994\" width=1080 height=606 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4440620/extras/4b018d4b31368a463c05d892d9e98ef4.webm?t=1784688994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4440620/extras/4b018d4b31368a463c05d892d9e98ef4.mp4?t=1784688994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter villages or castles, walk between buildings, hang out on rooftops, or find a place to relax and take beautiful screenshots. Free first person movement is available at all times at just the press of a button.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4440620/extras/6bdacf7a4604ee0b990e361ea93d401d.poster.avif?t=1784688994\" width=1080 height=606 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4440620/extras/6bdacf7a4604ee0b990e361ea93d401d.webm?t=1784688994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4440620/extras/6bdacf7a4604ee0b990e361ea93d401d.mp4?t=1784688994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also includes night mode with different lighting. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4440620/extras/6277b71ea0d600c6d4972b10c671f3de.poster.avif?t=1784688994\" wi